# Possessor of a Precious Soul - 2 (Q242), refused: a level 76 human Gladiator playing its base
# class, holding Virgil's letter, is turned away by Virgil, who takes subclasses only; the quest
# is not started and the letter is kept. Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q242_possessor_of_a_precious_soul_base_class.golden
